    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a loop that never ends. i try to be better, i really do, but then i just mess everything up again. it's like i'm broken. and the more i stay, the more i just see the disappointment in everyone's eyes. it's exhausting. i just want the noise to stop.",
